<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Confirmation de commande</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #1a73e8; padding: 30px 24px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
    .body { padding: 28px 24px; color: #333; }
    .body h2 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 18px; }
    .order-id { background: #f0f4ff; border-left: 4px solid #1a73e8; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 16px; }
    th { background: #f0f4ff; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; font-size: 13px; color: #555; }
    td { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-size: 14px; }
    .total-row td { font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; border-bottom: none; }
    .delivery-box { margin-top: 20px; background: #f9f9f9; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; }
    .footer { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 18px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; padding: 12px 28px; background: #1a73e8; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>BEM Shop — Confirmation de commande</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Bonjour {{clientFirstName}},</h2>
      <p>Merci pour votre commande ! Nous l'avons bien reçue et elle est en cours de traitement.</p>

      <div class="order-id">Commande #{{orderId}}</div>

      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Produit</th>
            <th>Qté</th>
            <th>Prix unitaire</th>
            <th>Sous-total</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each items}}
          <tr>
            <td>{{this.productName}}</td>
            <td>{{this.quantity}}</td>
            <td>{{this.unitPrice}} FCFA</td>
            <td>{{this.subtotal}} FCFA</td>
          </tr>
          {{/each}}
          <tr class="total-row">
            <td colspan="3">Total</td>
            <td>{{totalAmountFormatted}} FCFA</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="delivery-box">
        <strong>Mode de livraison :</strong> {{deliveryLabel}}<br/>
        {{#if address}}<strong>Adresse :</strong> {{address}}{{/if}}
      </div>

      <p>Vous serez notifié par email à chaque mise à jour de votre commande.</p>
      <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/orders" class="btn">Suivre ma commande</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; BEM Shop — Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
